WEBVTT

00:02:28.828 --> 00:02:31.553
I don't know where Julian Morrow got that from.

00:02:31.553 --> 00:02:33.109
(Laughter)

00:02:33.109 --> 00:02:34.930
I was pretty good in reading,

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:39.890
but religion and musical appreciation needed more work.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.366
(Laughter)

00:02:41.366 --> 00:02:43.453
When you leave the opera house,

00:02:43.453 --> 00:02:46.862
you'll find there's braille signage in the lifts.

00:02:46.862 --> 00:02:50.579
Look for it. Have you noticed it?

00:02:50.579 --> 00:02:53.309
I do. I look for it all the time.

00:02:53.309 --> 00:02:55.395
(Laughter)

00:02:55.395 --> 00:02:57.734
When I was at school,

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:01.026
the books were transcribed by transcribers,